```python
# example
```

{{< /code-tab >}}
{{< code-tab lang="pseudo" >}}

```text
STATE closed: CALL downstream
```

{{< /code-tab >}}
{{< /code-tabs >}}
```

### Shortcode contract

| Shortcode | Required params | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `code-tabs` | `default="java"`, `java="Java"`, `golang="Go"`, `python="Python"`, `pseudo="Pseudo"` | Omit unused langs by omitting their label param |
| `code-tab` | `lang="java"` \| `golang` \| `python` \| `pseudo` | Must match a key on parent |

- Use `{{<` / `>}}` delimiters when panels contain fenced code blocks.
- Java tab first (default).
- LLD posts still use `impl-tabs` (Java/Go only) — shared CSS/JS via `code-tabs.css` / `code-tabs.js`.

