## Mermaid Rules

| Do | Avoid |
|----|-----|
| `sequenceDiagram` for multi-service flows (§4) | Numbered step lists duplicating the diagram |
| `stateDiagram-v2` for breaker/lifecycle states | Unquoted special chars in labels |
| `flowchart LR` for topology (§3) | 12+ participants — split diagrams |
| `participant X as Display Name` aliases | Ambiguous node IDs (`Redis` as sole name) |

