## Workflow

1. Add topic slug to `data/microservices_modules.yaml` (if new)
2. Create/migrate `content/microservices/<slug>.md`
3. Put implementation code inside `code-tabs` / `code-tab`
4. Update `content/microservices/_index.md` if module structure changes
5. Preview: `hugo server -D` — hard refresh (`Ctrl+Shift+R`)
6. Set `draft: false` when ready

